      "en": "Batch end-to-end HLA typing wrapper for a BAM directory: extract HLA reads, run SpecHLA per sample, and merge results."
    },
    "notes": {
      "zh": "对一个BAM目录执行完整的批量HLA分型流程。该功能会为每个样本先提取HLA相关reads，再运行SpecHLA，保存各样本结果，支持基于完成标记的断点续跑/跳过，并最终生成合并结果表hla_result_merged.txt。",
      "en": "Runs a complete batch HLA typing workflow over a BAM directory. For each sample, it first extracts HLA-related reads and then runs SpecHLA, stores per-sample outputs, supports resume/skip based on completion markers, and finally generates a merged table hla_result_merged.txt.",
      "use_exon": "-u: Choose full-length or exon typing [0|1]. 0 indicates full-length, 1 means exon, default is 1. With Exome or RNA data, must select 1 (i.e., exon typing)."
    }
