    "function_summary": {
      "zh": "基于TPM矩阵的一体化TME流程：包含signature评分、6种免疫反卷积、LR评分及反卷积结果合并。",
      "en": "Integrated TPM-based TME profiling wrapper: signature scoring, six immune deconvolution methods, LR scoring, and merged deconvolution outputs."
    },
    "notes": {
      "zh": "使用一个命令完成基于TPM的TME profiling流程。该功能会串联运行calculate_sig_score、cibersort、IPS、estimate、mcpcounter、quantiseq、epic和LR_cal，生成标准化输出目录（signature、TME deconvolution、LR scoring），并将6种反卷积结果合并为一个总表。该流程不包含deside、bayesprism、tme_cluster或nmf。",
      "en": "Runs an end-to-end TPM-based TME profiling workflow in one command by chaining calculate_sig_score, cibersort, IPS, estimate, mcpcounter, quantiseq, epic, and LR_cal. Produces a standardized output structure (signature, TME deconvolution, LR scoring) and merges six deconvolution outputs into one summary table. This workflow does not include deside, bayesprism, tme_cluster, or nmf."
    }
  },
